# Design system — Mantine

Read `.arlox/design-system.json` — this project uses **Mantine** v7.

## Rules

- Import from `@mantine/core` — Button, TextInput, Paper, Stack, etc.
- Mantine styles are imported in `providers.tsx` (`@mantine/core/styles.css`).
- Do not mix antd, MUI, shadcn, or Chakra in the same project.

## Docs

https://mantine.dev/getting-started/
